MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_001: Hmm...
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_002: Excuse me, Promised One. My family sent me a\nletter, but apparently there's one for you as well.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_003: Oh! You're already reading it. Nothing too\npresumptuous, I hope.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_004: <NCA>"They ask that I watch over you."
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_005: Oh. I'm so sorry for that. You've got bigger concerns,\nlike saving the whole world.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_006: You'll have to forgive my family for their\nselfish request.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_007: <NCA>"It isn't selfish."
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_008: <NCB>"You have a good family."
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_009: <ACA>You think so? It's kind of you to say that.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_010: <ACB>W-well... Thank you. We are very close.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_011: The thing about my family is we don't hold back.\nWe're always getting into each other's business.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_012: We used to live on the lower level of the\nimperial capital. We were...not wealthy.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_013: They wrote that they were alright, but I wonder if\nthat's true. It's a concern.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_014: <NCA>"You can go to them now, if you want."
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_015: H-hold on. I'm not going home.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_016: I'm here to fight until the very end. I've been ready\nfor that from the start.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_017: Dagda is important, not just because of my family\nbut because of everyone else who lives here too.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_018: So I will not stop fighting, and protecting what is\ndear to me. 
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_019: <NCA>"You're standing a little close."
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_020: Oh! Sorry. Let me just step back.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_021: I get a little carried away sometimes. I can forget\nmy manners.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_022: Doing that to Centurio is one thing, but you...
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_023: <NCA>"It's all part of your charm."
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_024: R-really? I can't believe the Promised One is saying\nthat I have charm.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_025: In that case, let me just say one more thing.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_A_026: Until we've restored peace to our world, I'll continue\nfighting right by your side.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_001: Promised One, please... Please be safe.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_002: <NCA>"You're praying...for me?"
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_003: <NCB>"Open your eyes."
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_004: That voice... Promised One?
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_005: You're back! You're safe! I'm so happy.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_006: I was beginning to think I'd never see you again, but\nI just couldn't give up hope.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_007: <NCA>"What's the pot for?"
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_008: I made some food as an offering, in hopes that you'd\ncome back to us.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_009: One time, my little sister went missing in Dagsion.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_010: I went out looking for her, and I lugged around a pot\nof fish-and-vegetable stew.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_011: Cezarie zeroed in on the delicious smell, and she\nappeared right in front of me.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_012: So I've been taking this pot around to all the temples\nin the area.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_013: I thought if I made some food and offered some\nprayers, you'd find your way back to us.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_014: <NCA>"I wasn't lost."
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_015: <NCB>"The aroma did draw me here."
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_016: <ACA>We didn't know where you were, so to us it seemed\nlike you were lost.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_017: <ACB>Hehe. Worked like a charm.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_018: Anyway, I'm glad everyone's safe. You, me, and my\nfamily too.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_019: We survived, and you got to return to a\npeaceful world.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_020: No more fighting, no more losing what we hold\ndear... Feels like the days ahead will be happy ones.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_021: We'll cook, eat, sleep, maybe face some challenges\nonce in a while. It's a precious, ordinary life.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_022: But we should celebrate your return, with some food.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_023: <RSDS>Hehe. I happen to have a lead on some great stew.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_024: You already know this, but I tend to let myself get\nclose to people.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_025: So don't be surprised when I'm getting very close\nto you, Promised One.
MID_SE_Ism_Hur_S_026: And it all starts with some tasty stew.